(6587251, 980220, 140026, '<td valign="top">what''s the white outline fringe on the far left and right tree, and around some of the leaves? is that on the original photo? i like the beads on the web.</td>', 'what''s the white outline fringe on the far left and right tree, and around some of the leaves? is that on the original photo? i like the beads on the web.', '2011-11-07 06:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
