(6587254, 982673, 140026, '<td valign="top">maybe the red is over-cooked in the centre... reminded me of a colour tv with the colour set too high. otherwise nice composed i think</td>', 'maybe the red is over-cooked in the centre... reminded me of a colour tv with the colour set too high. otherwise nice composed i think', '2011-11-07 06:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6587255, 981335, 140026, '<td valign="top">someone has dropped a skip load of dry ice upstream?  i like the texture/dotted colours on the rocks</td>', 'someone has dropped a skip load of dry ice upstream?  i like the texture/dotted colours on the rocks', '2011-11-07 06:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6587257, 981233, 140026, '<td valign="top">the round dots at the back/centre spoil it for me. looks like they had turned spherical and maybe dilated somehow. far left the dots become distorted into ellipses, maybe it''s from the lens and not a result of post? sorry...</td>', 'the round dots at the back/centre spoil it for me. looks like they had turned spherical and maybe dilated somehow. far left the dots become distorted into ellipses, maybe it''s from the lens and not a result of post? sorry...', '2011-11-07 06:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6587258, 981744, 140026, '<td valign="top">if the person figure was slight more to the right, the eye would go past and further down the vanishing point? would it be breaking the spirit of the challenge rules if the graffiti was removed? (on the basis of it shouldn''t been there to start with) i like the way the trees above appear in composition.</td>', 'if the person figure was slight more to the right, the eye would go past and further down the vanishing point? would it be breaking the spirit of the challenge rules if the graffiti was removed? (on the basis of it shouldn''t been there to start with) i like the way the trees above appear in composition.', '2011-11-07 06:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6587260, 982792, 140026, '<td valign="top">yep this one does it for me</td>', 'yep this one does it for me', '2011-11-07 06:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6587261, 982680, 140026, '<td valign="top">i like it, all the colours to be expected of the time of year but not cluttered up with images of leaves, branches and trees, which i''d already seen before (a few times in my life)</td>', 'i like it, all the colours to be expected of the time of year but not cluttered up with images of leaves, branches and trees, which i''d already seen before (a few times in my life)', '2011-11-07 06:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6587262, 982380, 140026, '<td valign="top">composed nice</td>', 'composed nice', '2011-11-07 06:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6587263, 980923, 140026, '<td valign="top">Of motion blur I''m keen, but I''m seeing too much pure green for an autumnal scene</td>', 'Of motion blur I''m keen, but I''m seeing too much pure green for an autumnal scene', '2011-11-07 06:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6587266, 981056, 140026, '<td valign="top">i''d already seen this effect over 30 years ago.  film developed in a developing tank, rinse film in hot water so as make the gelatine reticulate.  Maybe the leaf outline could be softer, then the leaf would dominate the background, rather than it be drowning in a sea of ''find-edge'' effect?</td>', 'i''d already seen this effect over 30 years ago.  film developed in a developing tank, rinse film in hot water so as make the gelatine reticulate.  Maybe the leaf outline could be softer, then the leaf would dominate the background, rather than it be drowning in a sea of ''find-edge'' effect?', '2011-11-07 07:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6587268, 982236, 140026, '<td valign="top">another bucket of dry ice dumped in upstream, yawn...   nice composition and colours</td>', 'another bucket of dry ice dumped in upstream, yawn...   nice composition and colours', '2011-11-07 07:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6587270, 981243, 140026, '<td valign="top">the blurry snowflakes add a lot. nice colours. i don''t know if the (black/white) edge sharpening came from the camera, or whether sharpening was later added in post, but if too much used it gets a bit distracting. Just becoming noticable, look at black coloured branch/stem at right group of leaves, see the white fringe above and below?</td>', 'the blurry snowflakes add a lot. nice colours. i don''t know if the (black/white) edge sharpening came from the camera, or whether sharpening was later added in post, but if too much used it gets a bit distracting. Just becoming noticable, look at black coloured branch/stem at right group of leaves, see the white fringe above and below?', '2011-11-07 07:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6587272, 982493, 140026, '<td valign="top">nice contrast of colours. was the berry really freshly picked?</td>', 'nice contrast of colours. was the berry really freshly picked?', '2011-11-07 07:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6587273, 980551, 140026, '<td valign="top">what a nice composition, even the ashphalt ground has autumnal colours too</td>', 'what a nice composition, even the ashphalt ground has autumnal colours too', '2011-11-07 07:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6587276, 981234, 140026, '<td valign="top">i can''t seem to see any autumn colours here no matter how hard I try, maybe I just have no imagination at all...  I think it would look more silver if it was not sharpened so much in post. nice composition</td>', 'i can''t seem to see any autumn colours here no matter how hard I try, maybe I just have no imagination at all...  I think it would look more silver if it was not sharpened so much in post. nice composition', '2011-11-07 07:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6587279, 982284, 140026, '<td valign="top">Nope, I can''t see any autumn colours at all. Maybe it''s because I''m not wearing IR-vision glasses? Do you need them, like you do for 3-D?</td>', 'Nope, I can''t see any autumn colours at all. Maybe it''s because I''m not wearing IR-vision glasses? Do you need them, like you do for 3-D?', '2011-11-07 07:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6587282, 982582, 140026, '<td valign="top">another one with dry ice dumped upstream again?  I like the contrastng colours on the rocks. the sharpening effect (too much maybe) has adversely affected the sense of depth a bit, look at the top of the picture, the left rock''s right edge against the water flow. A touch of softening brush would fix it, but I think that may be against the editing rules? I find with sharpening effect, that it''s best to sleep on it and look again the next day before committing yourself to it.</td>', 'another one with dry ice dumped upstream again?  I like the contrastng colours on the rocks. the sharpening effect (too much maybe) has adversely affected the sense of depth a bit, look at the top of the picture, the left rock''s right edge against the water flow. A touch of softening brush would fix it, but I think that may be against the editing rules? I find with sharpening effect, that it''s best to sleep on it and look again the next day before committing yourself to it.', '2011-11-07 07:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6587283, 981859, 140026, '<td valign="top">quack!   you''d miss him if he wasn''t there</td>', 'quack!   you''d miss him if he wasn''t there', '2011-11-07 07:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6587284, 980310, 140026, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how you did this, but i like it</td>', 'I don''t know how you did this, but i like it', '2011-11-07 07:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6587286, 982825, 140026, '<td valign="top">this is one i reckon could get the ''grainy remix'' look?</td>', 'this is one i reckon could get the ''grainy remix'' look?', '2011-11-07 07:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6587289, 982831, 140026, '<td valign="top">more dry ice dumped upstream. i think i''ve seen too many of these type of stream shots now, i think after this i''ll skip any more i see without voting on them</td>', 'more dry ice dumped upstream. i think i''ve seen too many of these type of stream shots now, i think after this i''ll skip any more i see without voting on them', '2011-11-07 07:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6587298, 981300, 140026, '<td valign="top">is it just me or do i keep seeing side effects of image sharpening?  Look at the figure of person standing far right. Has a bright halo around. If you removed him, would there be one of those white outlines you see in a murder scene, you know the police draw on the ground where the body was found?   Nice the way the brown foliage is partly reflected by the water surface. (A great use for a polarising filter on the camera lens, so can fine tune the amount of reflection.)</td>', 'is it just me or do i keep seeing side effects of image sharpening?  Look at the figure of person standing far right. Has a bright halo around. If you removed him, would there be one of those white outlines you see in a murder scene, you know the police draw on the ground where the body was found?   Nice the way the brown foliage is partly reflected by the water surface. (A great use for a polarising filter on the camera lens, so can fine tune the amount of reflection.)', '2011-11-07 08:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6587299, 982204, 140026, '<td valign="top">best to take that woolly sock off the lens <i>before</i> taking the photo</td>', 'best to take that woolly sock off the lens before taking the photo', '2011-11-07 08:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6587300, 981058, 140026, '<td valign="top">natural selection?</td>', 'natural selection?', '2011-11-07 08:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6587301, 981402, 140026, '<td valign="top">i think i''d see the colours better if there wasn''t so much sharpening effect.</td>', 'i think i''d see the colours better if there wasn''t so much sharpening effect.', '2011-11-07 08:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6587307, 981094, 140026, '<td valign="top">some time elapsed before i noticed that they are headstones in a cemetery. if i''d of noticed earlier what they were, i think the picture would have more impact.  i reckon if you had stood on a step ladder to get up a bit more height viewpoint - that would give more depth. some edge ''fringing'' is going on with the red leaves that are against the grey sky, a bit distracting.</td>', 'some time elapsed before i noticed that they are headstones in a cemetery. if i''d of noticed earlier what they were, i think the picture would have more impact.  i reckon if you had stood on a step ladder to get up a bit more height viewpoint - that would give more depth. some edge ''fringing'' is going on with the red leaves that are against the grey sky, a bit distracting.', '2011-11-07 08:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6587318, 982601, 27812, '<td valign="top">Contrast!</td>', 'Contrast!', '2011-11-07 08:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6587353, 982353, 104230, '<td valign="top">This is lovely.  Great tonal range and lines.  My eye is drawn in to the picture beautifully. I fluctuate on whether I think the cat adds or detracts (the white in the cat''s coat being the brightest spot in the image, grabs my eye).  The leaves seem a bit unsharp/out of focus, but provide the desired effect none the less.</td>', 'This is lovely.  Great tonal range and lines.  My eye is drawn in to the picture beautifully. I fluctuate on whether I think the cat adds or detracts (the white in the cat''s coat being the brightest spot in the image, grabs my eye).  The leaves seem a bit unsharp/out of focus, but provide the desired effect none the less.', '2011-11-07 09:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
