(6589681, 982707, 37779, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>I love whatever amount of long exposure you did. The water looks beautiful. Not too much, not too little, just right!<br/> <br/>What I don''t like:<br/>The lighting is a slightly flat (perhaps a different time of day?), and the sharpening is too much.</td>', 'What I like:I love whatever amount of long exposure you did. The water looks beautiful. Not too much, not too little, just right! What I don''t like:The lighting is a slightly flat (perhaps a different time of day?), and the sharpening is too much.', '2011-11-08 18:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
