(6589801, 982437, 65234, '<td valign="top">No kidding!  Love the purple in the bokeh; very stormy and cold.  Nice job on the exposure to get the falling snow and still have sharpness on the leaves.</td>', 'No kidding!  Love the purple in the bokeh; very stormy and cold.  Nice job on the exposure to get the falling snow and still have sharpness on the leaves.', '2011-11-08 20:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
