(6590202, 980310, 98656, '<td valign="top">The</td>', 'The', '2011-11-09 03:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6590545, 982699, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think my #1 issue with this picture is that your driving on the wrong side of the car!!!!! lol.... No seriously, it is a tad dark and could use a bit more light. It also could use a bit more blur. So a touch longer shutter speed could have achieved both more light and more blur. However it is super sharp where it needs to be and the colors are great!</td>', 'I think my #1 issue with this picture is that your driving on the wrong side of the car!!!!! lol.... No seriously, it is a tad dark and could use a bit more light. It also could use a bit more blur. So a touch longer shutter speed could have achieved both more light and more blur. However it is super sharp where it needs to be and the colors are great!', '2011-11-09 11:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6590550, 982761, 10785, '<td valign="top">Funny that you entered a B&amp;W image for a challenge that for all intents and purposes is about color. But the title of the challenge is ambiguous enough to make it about foliage in general which makes this image a perfect fit. I like the light and darkness in the image and the clouds show great movement and lead my eye right to the foliage on the tree which is silhouetted nicely showing off good detail.</td>', 'Funny that you entered a B&W image for a challenge that for all intents and purposes is about color. But the title of the challenge is ambiguous enough to make it about foliage in general which makes this image a perfect fit. I like the light and darkness in the image and the clouds show great movement and lead my eye right to the foliage on the tree which is silhouetted nicely showing off good detail.', '2011-11-09 11:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6590552, 981079, 10785, '<td valign="top">Rich color with a lot of interest!</td>', 'Rich color with a lot of interest!', '2011-11-09 11:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6590556, 982749, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good shot but a little lacking in the foilage. It is taken a little late in the season.</td>', 'Good shot but a little lacking in the foilage. It is taken a little late in the season.', '2011-11-09 11:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6590672, 982664, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice find. There feels like there is a hidden meaning for the viewer to explore.<br/> <br/>Note that this image highly suffers from chromatic aberration. Look at the tops of the trees in the sky, and notice all the cyan/pink coloring? That''s easily fixable in post processing and can help your image look a lot nicer.</td>', 'Nice find. There feels like there is a hidden meaning for the viewer to explore. Note that this image highly suffers from chromatic aberration. Look at the tops of the trees in the sky, and notice all the cyan/pink coloring? That''s easily fixable in post processing and can help your image look a lot nicer.', '2011-11-09 13:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6590673, 982545, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really like this. With the way the colors pop against the white, it''s very cool. I wish some of the leaves would still be on trees here, I would definitely try to replicate with today''s snow storm.</td>', 'I really like this. With the way the colors pop against the white, it''s very cool. I wish some of the leaves would still be on trees here, I would definitely try to replicate with today''s snow storm.', '2011-11-09 13:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
