(6590680, 982560, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the view and mix of colors. I do wonder if this could have been more effective with higher contrast levels. Right now, it looks a bit washed out to me.</td>', 'I like the view and mix of colors. I do wonder if this could have been more effective with higher contrast levels. Right now, it looks a bit washed out to me.', '2011-11-09 13:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
