(6591095, 981470, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the wintry tones to the sky and water.  Autumn''s brief burst of glory is almost over.</td>', 'Love the wintry tones to the sky and water.  Autumn''s brief burst of glory is almost over.', '2011-11-09 21:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591101, 982500, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good Selective Desat. I would like to see it with the green lawn to compare because I think that the red leaves would pop off of that as well. BUt here, the greytone background gives it the emotion/impact of a B&amp;W image with the pop of color to give it that fall foliage flare!!</td>', 'Good Selective Desat. I would like to see it with the green lawn to compare because I think that the red leaves would pop off of that as well. BUt here, the greytone background gives it the emotion/impact of a B&W image with the pop of color to give it that fall foliage flare!!', '2011-11-09 21:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591102, 982702, 10785, '<td valign="top">great angle!</td>', 'great angle!', '2011-11-09 21:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591103, 982833, 10785, '<td valign="top">excellent complimentary colors!! I would like to see the tree a little brighter if that is at all posible.</td>', 'excellent complimentary colors!! I would like to see the tree a little brighter if that is at all posible.', '2011-11-09 21:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591107, 982458, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is great! I like the soft focus and all the red color! I am on the fence with the dress color. (I take it this shot was staged and not happened upon.) I think it is somewhat neutral and could stand to be a complementary color for added pop! And give that gal a sweater... it''s fall out there ya know!!! lol.</td>', 'This is great! I like the soft focus and all the red color! I am on the fence with the dress color. (I take it this shot was staged and not happened upon.) I think it is somewhat neutral and could stand to be a complementary color for added pop! And give that gal a sweater... it''s fall out there ya know!!! lol.', '2011-11-09 21:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591108, 982381, 10785, '<td valign="top">Bright and crisp! I like it!</td>', 'Bright and crisp! I like it!', '2011-11-09 21:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591110, 981592, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is good foliage!!</td>', 'This is good foliage!!', '2011-11-09 21:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591118, 982825, 10785, '<td valign="top">You have a great focal point, awesome color and it is tack sharp. I am voting on those merits alone. As for your concept, this is great for background, but I think it is lacking a subject. I think it needs something more in the composition to give it that nymph fantasy look... softer focus, a little person peeping from behind a tree... something.</td>', 'You have a great focal point, awesome color and it is tack sharp. I am voting on those merits alone. As for your concept, this is great for background, but I think it is lacking a subject. I think it needs something more in the composition to give it that nymph fantasy look... softer focus, a little person peeping from behind a tree... something.', '2011-11-09 21:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591316, 982792, 17153, '<td valign="top">wow, great details and colors! is it hdr? 10</td>', 'wow, great details and colors! is it hdr? 10', '2011-11-10 07:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591321, 982816, 114969, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, the tones work so well together! love it.</td>', 'Beautiful, the tones work so well together! love it.', '2011-11-10 07:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591322, 982278, 114969, '<td valign="top">I really love these trees, they are quite unusual around here, but they are very beautiful to the point I think we are going to try and make one grow. Thanks for sharing with us this incredible view! (bumped the score)<br/>ETA: If you could take a photo of those at morning, with a pinkish sky, I think you would get really something fantastic!</td>', 'I really love these trees, they are quite unusual around here, but they are very beautiful to the point I think we are going to try and make one grow. Thanks for sharing with us this incredible view! (bumped the score)ETA: If you could take a photo of those at morning, with a pinkish sky, I think you would get really something fantastic!', '2011-11-10 07:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
