(6593011, 981909, 104230, '<td valign="top">Interesting. It has a woodcut/etching feel to it which I like a lot. Just enough light on the tree tops to make it special, and lovely mixture of appealing hues.</td>', 'Interesting. It has a woodcut/etching feel to it which I like a lot. Just enough light on the tree tops to make it special, and lovely mixture of appealing hues.', '2011-11-12 16:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6593044, 981744, 104230, '<td valign="top">Striking image, and in general I like images with strong patterns and shapes, but for my eyes the railings here dominate the image too much.  They lead my eye to a part of the image that is hard to make out and does not appear that interesting at least in terms of foliage.</td>', 'Striking image, and in general I like images with strong patterns and shapes, but for my eyes the railings here dominate the image too much.  They lead my eye to a part of the image that is hard to make out and does not appear that interesting at least in terms of foliage.', '2011-11-12 16:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
