(6594218, 982681, 69008, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing that the voters didn''t like your shadow in this one. Most of the voters don''t take time to check the titles, esp on a vertical shot where they have to scroll to see it.  I do understand how you set up your shadow to mesh with the line of shadows.  <br/>Generally, if I''m shooting with the sun at my back, I try to move into the shadow of something, so my shadow is not a part of the image. <br/>I like the leading line/curve in this one, and the pretty sky.</td>', 'I''m guessing that the voters didn''t like your shadow in this one. Most of the voters don''t take time to check the titles, esp on a vertical shot where they have to scroll to see it.  I do understand how you set up your shadow to mesh with the line of shadows.  Generally, if I''m shooting with the sun at my back, I try to move into the shadow of something, so my shadow is not a part of the image. I like the leading line/curve in this one, and the pretty sky.', '2011-11-14 00:47:30.000000', NULL, 0),
