(6595362, 982353, 43463, '<td valign="top">There is just something about the texture and the mood of this composition. The autumn leaves have gathered into this barren but seemingly cozy shelter of from the elements. The closed off walls offer shelter not just to the plantlife clinging to the walls, but the fallen folliage, and the cat who is curled up near the fallen leaves as if it is a blanket.</td>', 'There is just something about the texture and the mood of this composition. The autumn leaves have gathered into this barren but seemingly cozy shelter of from the elements. The closed off walls offer shelter not just to the plantlife clinging to the walls, but the fallen folliage, and the cat who is curled up near the fallen leaves as if it is a blanket.', '2011-11-15 10:13:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(6595371, 982702, 43463, '<td valign="top">The ripples of water that push the leaves are like the breath of wind that toss the autumn leaves off of the sheltering branches of the tree. The dark eddys and whorls is like a watercolor - the dock piling invokes the idea that we are sitting at the edge of the dock fishing and daydreaming as we watch the leaves drift by.</td>', 'The ripples of water that push the leaves are like the breath of wind that toss the autumn leaves off of the sheltering branches of the tree. The dark eddys and whorls is like a watercolor - the dock piling invokes the idea that we are sitting at the edge of the dock fishing and daydreaming as we watch the leaves drift by.', '2011-11-15 10:18:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(6595372, 980612, 43463, '<td valign="top">I love the feel and mood that this invoked...I think too many times we get mesmorized by sharp detail, strong contrasts and rich colors that one forgets that faded colors can work quite well in creating a mood that is rich in feel. I feel the fading colors of autumn, the crisp winds that herald the chill of winter, and the loneliness of the pealing paint weather worn bench whose only compnay is the few scattered leaves sitting upon it.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-11-15 10:40:51.</i></td>', 'I love the feel and mood that this invoked...I think too many times we get mesmorized by sharp detail, strong contrasts and rich colors that one forgets that faded colors can work quite well in creating a mood that is rich in feel. I feel the fading colors of autumn, the crisp winds that herald the chill of winter, and the loneliness of the pealing paint weather worn bench whose only compnay is the few scattered leaves sitting upon it.', '2011-11-15 10:25:07.000000', '2011-11-15 10:40:51.000000', 0),
(6595381, 980551, 43463, '<td valign="top">I love entries that have double or several meanings. I really enjoyed the play on the meaning of season - there are two: the tennis season and the season autumn with rich and lovely colors adorning the trees has fallen. Nice rich details and colors and even strong leading lines of the tennis court to draw the eye in.</td>', 'I love entries that have double or several meanings. I really enjoyed the play on the meaning of season - there are two: the tennis season and the season autumn with rich and lovely colors adorning the trees has fallen. Nice rich details and colors and even strong leading lines of the tennis court to draw the eye in.', '2011-11-15 10:29:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(6595398, 981812, 43463, '<td valign="top">What this best captures is the movement of the season - the feel of the wind as it lashes at the last golden tones of autumn that clings to the tree branches. The composition is both warm and cold. Warm because of the lovely golden tones in the single visible leaf and the blur of those we cannot see clearly. Cold because the capture of movement makes me feel the chill of the wind that will eventually cast that leaf off of it''s secure anchor on the tree branch. The focus and colors are soft but that just adds to the appeal for it gives it a dreamy feel.</td>', 'What this best captures is the movement of the season - the feel of the wind as it lashes at the last golden tones of autumn that clings to the tree branches. The composition is both warm and cold. Warm because of the lovely golden tones in the single visible leaf and the blur of those we cannot see clearly. Cold because the capture of movement makes me feel the chill of the wind that will eventually cast that leaf off of it''s secure anchor on the tree branch. The focus and colors are soft but that just adds to the appeal for it gives it a dreamy feel.', '2011-11-15 10:36:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(6595411, 981079, 43463, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the blue! Love the rich, hues in this photo and the lines of the tree that weave &amp; curve. Your capture showcases the beauty of the garden i that is captivating to look upon when autumn has arrived.</td>', 'Congrats on the blue! Love the rich, hues in this photo and the lines of the tree that weave & curve. Your capture showcases the beauty of the garden i that is captivating to look upon when autumn has arrived.', '2011-11-15 10:44:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(6595415, 982658, 43463, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the HM! I love the play of light upon these frosty leaves. The level of detail in the leaves and the ice crystals made my teeth chatter from the chill.</td>', 'Congrats on the HM! I love the play of light upon these frosty leaves. The level of detail in the leaves and the ice crystals made my teeth chatter from the chill.', '2011-11-15 10:47:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(6595425, 982489, 43463, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your ribbon! The details of this fern unfurling is stunning. What I find captivating is details of the shapes and lines. The compact pockets of leaves that are curled into a shell like chamber and  the way the line of ''branches'' flow and curl throughout the composition - it draws the eye in and holds the attention.</td>', 'Congrats on your ribbon! The details of this fern unfurling is stunning. What I find captivating is details of the shapes and lines. The compact pockets of leaves that are curled into a shell like chamber and  the way the line of ''branches'' flow and curl throughout the composition - it draws the eye in and holds the attention.', '2011-11-15 10:59:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(6595454, 981812, 118154, '<td valign="top">Congrats Lavi,some real nice comments here.</td>', 'Congrats Lavi,some real nice comments here.', '2011-11-15 11:35:12.000000', NULL, 0);
