(6597348, 982735, 33068, '<td valign="top">Very pretty image.<br/></td>', 'Very pretty image.', '2011-11-17 17:02:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(6597475, 980220, 115664, '<td valign="top">The light around the trees and some of the leaves is the morning sun rising and yes it is on the original photograph. I don''t do much editing!</td>', 'The light around the trees and some of the leaves is the morning sun rising and yes it is on the original photograph. I don''t do much editing!', '2011-11-17 20:49:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(6597890, 981075, 96751, '<td valign="top">Magnificent still life, Chrystyne!</td>', 'Magnificent still life, Chrystyne!', '2011-11-18 11:29:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(6597933, 982318, 112828, '<td valign="top">Love the blur buddy!</td>', 'Love the blur buddy!', '2011-11-18 12:28:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(6598160, 981075, 133346, '<td valign="top">I loved to see this picture....it did remind me of when i was a girl, 7 or maybe 8 yrs old, and with the first rains of the season i used to find snails in my garden everwhere, so one day i decided that i wanted to be a ''snail breeder'' .... So i took a shoes box and filled it up with leaves and stones, and i went to put in there a few snails.... I did well for the first day, as per for the second all of them where gone away..except fir one, who was hiding exactly like the one in your picture....it made me smile, and i decided to get her back from where i took it....-so my snail business ended there :)<br/> <br/>Have forgotten this for a long time. It was nice to remember. Thank you.lovely one</td>', 'I loved to see this picture....it did remind me of when i was a girl, 7 or maybe 8 yrs old, and with the first rains of the season i used to find snails in my garden everwhere, so one day i decided that i wanted to be a ''snail breeder'' .... So i took a shoes box and filled it up with leaves and stones, and i went to put in there a few snails.... I did well for the first day, as per for the second all of them where gone away..except fir one, who was hiding exactly like the one in your picture....it made me smile, and i decided to get her back from where i took it....-so my snail business ended there :) Have forgotten this for a long time. It was nice to remember. Thank you.lovely one', '2011-11-18 20:06:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6598376, 982489, 101668, '<td valign="top">Stunning indeed. Congrats a well deserved ribbon in ages!<br/></td>', 'Stunning indeed. Congrats a well deserved ribbon in ages!', '2011-11-19 07:14:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(6598539, 982744, 117474, '<td valign="top">Something else I do with hdr sometimes (mentioning because of your sky hate) in advanced challenges is... say for this image. Edit it for the vineyards in photomatix. When you''re done with that then open it up in Photoshop or whatever you might use. Copy one of the original exposures into a layer and mask it so that it only shows the sky. I very rarely have the whole image photomatix''d.<br/>But great finish.</td>', 'Something else I do with hdr sometimes (mentioning because of your sky hate) in advanced challenges is... say for this image. Edit it for the vineyards in photomatix. When you''re done with that then open it up in Photoshop or whatever you might use. Copy one of the original exposures into a layer and mask it so that it only shows the sky. I very rarely have the whole image photomatix''d.But great finish.', '2011-11-19 12:14:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(6598765, 981079, 27559, '<td valign="top">A really beautiful photograph.Very rarely seen so may colors in one photo.Congrats.</td>', 'A really beautiful photograph.Very rarely seen so may colors in one photo.Congrats.', '2011-11-20 00:50:50.000000', NULL, 0),
