(6615740, 982730, 91783, '<td valign="top">good job! next time, though, i would suggest bring out even more detail with sharpening it. nice color and exposure.</td>', 'good job! next time, though, i would suggest bring out even more detail with sharpening it. nice color and exposure.', '2011-12-10 20:15:54.000000', NULL, 0),
